<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0633_T30R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A clan of Hustlers who command\nDragon homies live right here in\fBlackthorn.\rSo this town got MAD dragon\nlegends. And mad dragon insurance\fclaims.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0633_T30R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair and Lance trained here to\nlevel up!\rLance left a cape in the closet. We\nstill got it. It smell like dragon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0633_T30R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">DRATINI: Draa!</language>
	</row>
